 coordination that is clear, documentation-aware, and easy to move through internal review.\n\nTypical Support Areas:\n- MOQ flexibility support for program planning\n- Documentation support for technical and commercial stakeholders\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination for qualified opportunities\n\nIf useful, we would be glad to discuss what {{company_name}} is currently working through.\n\nReply to: {{reply_to_email}}\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', 0, 1, NOW(), NOW()),
(1, 'Initial Outreach - Research Supply Buyers', 'Research supply buyers', 'Professional sourcing support for {{company_name}}', 'Documentation-first support for qualified research supply sourcing conversations.', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\n{{brand_name}} supports qualified B2B research supply buyers with straightforward sourcing coordination and documentation-aware communication.\n\nOur goal is to keep the conversation useful, credible, and easy for internal review.\n\nWhy Teams Work With Atlas BioLabs:\n- MOQ flexibility support when requirements vary by project stage\n- Documentation support for internal evaluation\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination with qualified B2B communication\n\nIf this is relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to continue the conversation.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', '<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">{{brand_name}} supports qualified B2B research supply buyers with straightforward sourcing coordination and documentation-aware communication.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Our goal is to keep the conversation useful, credible, and easy for internal review.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">Why Teams Work With Atlas BioLabs</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support when requirements vary by project stage</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Documentation support for internal evaluation</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Batch transparency and sourcing coordination with qualified B2B communication</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If this is relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to continue the conversation.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject=Atlas%20BioLabs%20Research%20Sourcing%20Discussion\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Request a Quote</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">If you prefer, reply directly with the product and quantity range you are reviewing.</div>', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\n{{brand_name}} supports qualified B2B research supply buyers with straightforward sourcing coordination and documentation-aware communication.\n\nOur goal is to keep the conversation useful, credible, and easy for internal review.\n\nWhy Teams Work With Atlas BioLabs:\n- MOQ flexibility support when requirements vary by project stage\n- Documentation support for internal evaluation\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination with qualified B2B communication\n\nIf this is relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to continue the conversation.\n\nReply to: {{reply_to_email}}\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', 0, 1, NOW(), NOW()),
(1, 'Follow-Up 1', 'Other', 'Checking in on your sourcing review at {{company_name}}', 'A quick follow-up in case your team is still reviewing priorities.', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI wanted to follow up on my earlier note from {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf {{company_name}} is still reviewing peptide sourcing needs, we would be glad to continue the conversation in a concise, requirement-focused way.\n\nWhat We Can Help With:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination\n\nIf useful, reply with the category or sourcing requirement your team is reviewing.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', '<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">I wanted to follow up on my earlier note from {{brand_name}}.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If {{company_name}} is still reviewing peptide sourcing needs, we would be glad to continue the conversation in a concise, requirement-focused way.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:18px 20px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">What We Can Help With</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Documentation support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Batch transparency and sourcing coordination</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If useful, reply with the category or sourcing requirement your team is reviewing.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject=Atlas%20BioLabs%20Follow-up\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Reply to This Email</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">We can keep the conversation focused and practical if the timing is right.</div>', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI wanted to follow up on my earlier note from {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf {{company_name}} is still reviewing peptide sourcing needs, we would be glad to continue the conversation in a concise, requirement-focused way.\n\nWhat We Can Help With:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination\n\nIf useful, reply with the category or sourcing requirement your team is reviewing.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', 1, 1, NOW(), NOW()),
(1, 'Follow-Up 2', 'Other', 'Leaving the door open for {{company_name}}', 'A final respectful follow-up from Atlas BioLabs.', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI am closing the loop on my previous note from {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf sourcing support, documentation alignment, MOQ planning, or batch transparency becomes relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to help when the timing is better.\n\nTypical Support Areas:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Sourcing coordination and qualified B2B communication\n\nThank you for your time.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', '<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">I am closing the loop on my previous note from {{brand_name}}.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If sourcing support, documentation alignment, MOQ planning, or batch transparency becomes relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to help when the timing is better.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:18px 20px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">Typical Support Areas</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Documentation support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Sourcing coordination and qualified B2B communication</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If timing changes later, a brief reply is enough and we can pick up the conversation from there.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject=Atlas%20BioLabs%20Future%20Follow-up\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Keep in Touch</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">No pressure. We prefer clear, useful follow-up over repeated noise.</div>', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI am closing the loop on my previous note from {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf sourcing support, documentation alignment, MOQ planning, or batch transparency becomes relevant for {{company_name}}, we would be glad to help when the timing is better.\n\nTypical Support Areas:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Sourcing coordination and qualified B2B communication\n\nThank you for your time.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', 2, 1, NOW(), NOW()),
(1, 'RFQ Confirmation', 'Other', 'Your Atlas BioLabs RFQ is under review', 'We received your request and will review the details before following up.', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nThank you for contacting {{brand_name}}. We received your RFQ and will review the request for sourcing fit, documentation expectations, MOQ support, and next-step coordination.\n\nWhat happens next:\n- Your request is reviewed by the team\n- We assess product interest, quantity, and documentation needs\n- We follow up using the contact details you provided\n\n{{default_signature}}', '<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Thank you for contacting {{brand_name}}. We received your RFQ and will review the request for sourcing fit, documentation expectations, MOQ support, and next-step coordination.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">What Happens Next</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Your request is reviewed by the team</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">We assess product interest, quantity, and documentation needs</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">We follow up using the contact details you provided</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If there is anything else we should review, feel free to reply directly with additional context.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject=Atlas%20BioLabs%20RFQ%20Follow-up\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Reply with Additional Details</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">We will keep the follow-up focused on the sourcing details relevant to your request.</div>', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nThank you for contacting {{brand_name}}. We received your RFQ and will review the request for sourcing fit, documentation expectations, MOQ support, and next-step coordination.\n\nWhat happens next:\n- Your request is reviewed by the team\n- We assess product interest, quantity, and documentation needs\n- We follow up using the contact details you provided\n\n{{default_signature}}', 9, 1, NOW(), NOW()),
(1, 'Quote Follow-Up', 'Other', 'Following up on your Atlas BioLabs quote', 'A practical follow-up in case your team is reviewing details internally.', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI wanted to follow up on the quote or sourcing discussion with {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf your team is reviewing quantities, timing, documentation, or commercial fit, we would be glad to help move the conversation forward in a clear and practical way.\n\nWhy Teams Work With Atlas BioLabs:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination\n\nIf useful, reply with any open questions and we can respond directly.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', '<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">Hello {{contact_name}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">I wanted to follow up on the quote or sourcing discussion with {{brand_name}}.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If your team is reviewing quantities, timing, documentation, or commercial fit, we would be glad to help move the conversation forward in a clear and practical way.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#F7FAFD;border:1px solid #DCE6F2;border-radius:16px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px;color:#0A1A2F;text-transform:uppercase;\">Why Teams Work With Atlas BioLabs</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">MOQ flexibility support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Documentation support</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#2E6BFF;border-radius:50%;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\"padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#243548;\">Batch transparency and sourcing coordination</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#243548;\">If useful, reply with any open questions and we can respond directly.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\"><tr><td><a href=\"mailto:{{reply_to_email}}?subject=Atlas%20BioLabs%20Quote%20Follow-up\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E6BFF;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:15px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;\">Continue the Discussion</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5B6B7E;\">We can keep the follow-up focused on the specific details your team needs to review internally.</div>', 'Hello {{contact_name}},\n\nI wanted to follow up on the quote or sourcing discussion with {{brand_name}}.\n\nIf your team is reviewing quantities, timing, documentation, or commercial fit, we would be glad to help move the conversation forward in a clear and practical way.\n\nWhy Teams Work With Atlas BioLabs:\n- MOQ flexibility support\n- Documentation support\n- Batch transparency and sourcing coordination\n\nIf useful, reply with any open questions and we can respond directly.\n\n{{default_signature}}\n\nUnsubscribe: {{unsubscribe_link}}', 3, 1, NOW(), NOW())
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
category = VALUES(category),
subject = VALUES(subject),
preheader = VALUES(preheader),
body = VALUES(body),
